{"title":"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is a nonzero integer and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is a positive number such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/0/4c0e2859688e1c63db0603217a957a5ecc097fd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab^2=\\log_{10}b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"19\" />, what is the median of the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/4/1d4ed5ec3eccd52ad1bbb18afe1924d0c93176ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{0,1,a,b,1/b\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/818e129d118f75247216378926a023238a88d105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ a \\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ b \\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\frac{1}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"344\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is positive, then, the equation will have no solutions for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. This becomes more obvious by noting that at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/4/cb47ab1777d77a0796b7d7732b5e33ca9e669091.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab^2 &gt; \\log_{10} b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"19\" />. The LHS quadratic function will increase faster than the RHS logarithmic function, so they will never intersect.\n</p><p>This puts <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> as the smallest in the set since it must be negative.\n</p><p>Checking the new equation: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/8/508641f491c8e01ddd75283359b5936ce18dae55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-b^2 = \\log_{10}b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Near <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/4/fc43f0ea59e862d7db01586894e9eea730d427b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/c/7fc7e934718c71515bf5c0d7933d2dd1586f59b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-b^2 &gt; \\log_{10} b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"19\" /> but at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/5/cf590e9abb33aa9776ddc386b1ba6ee7b43fa413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/d/fbd9b97b24cea9873f383d6e5479f35f02efa75f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-b^2 &lt; \\log_{10} b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>This implies that the solution occurs somewhere in between: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/a/9cabde1685a6e1d28759e7155a6ac61afd3e7409.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; b &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>This also implies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/7/6c7a12b6bedb3d3c655c04b26eda94ea8f1f2246.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{b} &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"45\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>This makes our set (ordered)\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/6/76698d8d32d66cf96d89e453e08d6e0008f6c1b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{a,0,b,1,1/b\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>The median is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/e/16ebdf7cba3993cfe8dee188add6692b713ac46a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\Rightarrow \\mathrm {(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/e/4fecd255e5da022c505de5e7a71f37afaf02c31d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=0.1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/0/1f0bb2e5450c9d47e0c08599001d2632a67a7590.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\cdot0.01 = -1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" /> giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/2/24250c0db4b09bd91d676d98768ce3ab7ad0f747.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=-100$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"74\" height=\"13\" />. Then the ordered set is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/c/a7c04e8d3225419fbadff55a2637398fb1f4caf1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{-100, 0, 0.1, 1, 10\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" /> and the median is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/f/19fa6fc465ee382cbe2b0daa7e8b5549b2c22350.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.1=b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" /> so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/1/931c46d937d19ddb7256f87d68149cf5729ddeb6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm {(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B\">2007 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.